TAPNOVA 4.0 — created by 1TapGod

This distribution is a modified version of MSP2 MultiTool v3, based on
MSP2TOOL Desktop / 6x0k Space by 6x0k.
Original project: https://github.com/6x0k/MSP2TOOL-Desktop-x64

Changes in this edition: TAPNOVA name, visual identity, original vector mark,
desktop interface, Polish desktop messages, extension branding and default
appearance, executable metadata, build packaging and documentation.
The bundled extension retains its upstream game functionality.

Version 3.1 adds a responsive panel presentation layer (panel-ui.js),
navigation styling, orbital welcome artwork and section shortcuts.

Version 4.0 adds the cross-platform Electron desktop shell, an editable Figma
design, local Inter fonts, accessible keyboard routing and focus preservation
for autograph search. Electron and Chromium license notices are included with
their runtimes. Inter is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; its full
license is bundled in desktop/generated/Inter-OFL.txt.

The existing Apache License 2.0 is provided in LICENSE. Original notices
and upstream documentation are retained in docs and Resources/Extension.
